silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_chapters_02_twelve_leg_deep_dive_sections_11_classification_leg_concrete_anchor#domesticcat silm:hasLongDescription "The DomesticCat is DomesticCat: the species-type classification node for Felis catus (domestic cat); a type in the local olog; distinct from the individual Mittens and distinct from the ITIS taxon row FelisCatusTSN183798." .
